-/**
- * Verifies the GCP leg: AK->Google root, SEV report bound to sha512(akPub||bound),
- * AK-signed SHA-256 quote (nonce sha256(bound)) -> PCRs, PCR8 proves the app hash.
- */
-export function verifyGcpLeg(
